",\\\"blocking\\\":true,\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Make retryable failures honor max 3 retries with exponential backoff and update focused tests accordingly.\\\",\\\"acceptance_criteria\\\":[\\\"ChatClient uses 3 retries max for retryable failures.\\\",\\\"Focused tests assert 4 total attempts for retryable 429/500/timeout cases.\\\",\\\"Non-retryable auth failures still fail fast.\\\"],\\\"task_type\\\":\\\"bugfix\\\"}]\nEXPECTED behavior: recoverable network and retryable API failures should use exponential backoff for up to 3 retries before surfacing the final error.\nOBSERVED behavior: ChatClient is configured with max_retries 2, so it makes 3 total attempts and sleeps twice before raising the final error. Independent reproduction output: max_retries 2; stream_calls 3; sleep_calls 2; raised ApiError 500 [API_ERROR] Server error from the API. Retry shortly; the service may be degraded.\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Run: uv run pytest -q tests/test_chat_client.py tests/test_agent_core.py tests/test_sessions.py tests/test_agent_tui.py\n2. Run:\n   uv run python - <<\\\"PY\\\"\n   import asyncio\n   from unittest.mock import AsyncMock, MagicMock, patch\n   import anthropic\n   from goz.agent.chat_client import ChatClient\n   from goz.config import Config\n\n   async def main():\n       client = ChatClient(Config(zai_token=\\\"test-token\\\"))\n       print(\\\"max_retries\\\", client.max_retries)\n       mock_response = MagicMock(); mock_response.status_code = 500\n       class ErrorContext:\n           async def __aenter__(self):\n               raise anthropic.APIStatusError(message=\\\"Server unavailable\\\", response=mock_response, body=None)\n           async def __aexit__(self, *args):\n               pass\n       with patch.object(client._client, \\\"messages\\\") as mock_messages, patch(\\\"goz.agent.chat_client.asyncio.sleep\\\", new=AsyncMock()) as mock_sleep:\n           mock_messages.stream.side_effect = [ErrorContext(), ErrorContext(), ErrorContext()]\n           try:\n               async for _ in client.chat_completion([{\\\"role\\\": \\\"user\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Hello\\\"}]):\n                   pass\n           except Exception as e:\n               print(\\\"raised\\\", type(e).__name__, getattr(e, \\\"statusCode\\\", None), str(e))\n           print(\\\"stream_calls\\\", mock_messages.stream.call_count)\n           print(\\\"sleep_calls\\\", mock_sleep.await_count)\n   asyncio.run(main())\n   PY\nCriteria not met: Automatic retry with exponential backoff (max 3 retries), plus the retry portion of the network and retryable API criteria.\nCriteria already satisfied: 401 auth handling, user-friendly error messages, tool error formatting, context preservation after errors, and graceful shutdown with unsaved changes prompt.'\"","aggregated_output":"task: T-0002\nstep: accepting\nverdict: reject\nrole: reviewer\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
